Prior formalization
-------------------
The existing source comments record these adaptations:
* lean/FreeEntropy/Channels.lean: Kraus/amplification proofs adapted from
  Cloning-github/formalization/Cloning/Channels.lean.
* lean/FreeEntropy/CartanChannel.lean: forward slice/Kraus and partial-trace
  algebra adapted from Cloning/CartanChannel.lean, Cloning/Compression.lean,
  and Cloning/MatrixPartialTraceCovariance.lean in that earlier project.

Those modules are source-level adaptations, not hidden build dependencies.
The earlier source was identified in a maintainer-controlled private
repository and the four source files were matched against that record.
No repository-wide license or copyright notice covering those modules was
found. A publicly accessible upstream reference and the licensing record
remain incomplete; do not infer Apache-2.0 coverage for those portions from
the proposed license. No additional code from that repository was added
during release preparation.

